    "scope": "The 19-point circular roof matches the known golden dome coordinates and its published 42.10 m exterior circumference. Named OpenStreetMap ways establish the Old Court perimeter, the east Naqqara Khana, west clock range, north iwan and adjoining sanctuary roof boundaries."
